 "description": "An elevated water tower: a steel tank with a rounded bottom, stiffening hoops, a conical roof with a vent and a red aviation light on a finial, a central riser pipe and a balcony with brackets and railings. It stands either on splayed steel legs with concrete footings, horizontal struts and X-bracing rods, with a ladder up the front leg, or on a tapering concrete column with a flared head, a door at its foot facing +Z and slit windows.",
